            "text": "Stdlib xml.etree used to parse the MITRE corpus in harvest_cwe_names.py and name_diff.py. Input is SHA-256-pinned with chain-of-custody verification (name_diff.py provenance guards), and both scripts are regeneration-only with no production caller, so exposure is negligible. defusedxml would harden against crafted-XML resource exhaustion if these scripts are ever pointed at untrusted corpora."
